5 Concluding Remarks
---------------------



In this work, we proposed two algorithms that solve multi-agent classification problems while enforcing collaboration and two forms of smoothing: global over the graph and local over the neighbourhoods. We provided convergence results for one of the algorithms, while indicating that the same approach applies to the other one. We noticed that collaboration through smoothing improves performance. Future work involves examining different optimization formulations that allow for other forms of smoothing coupled with automatic clustering of agents into classes.
